# Ollama

## Parmeters

Arquitecture: Structure and goal of the model (LLMA means Large Language Model Meta AI)
Parameter: Size and bias used for the model to learn (in B size)
Contex lenght: Amount of Token can process in a single input
Embedding lenght: The amount of embeeding space it have for text interpretation
Quantization: compress model in exchange of logic (in B)

Library model, like codeGemma, is a collection of light model for variaty.\
